# Throwaway test build: the repo's own .dockerignore is "exclude everything
# except a pre-built binary", which would strip the Go source out of the
# context and break the `COPY . .` in Dockerfile.test. This permissive
# override keeps the whole source tree and only drops VCS metadata and any
# frontend dependency trees, so the build context stays small but complete.
.git/
**/node_modules/
web/dashboard/node_modules/
